index 3fc29db..dde0788 100644
--- a/src/main/resources/Documentation/about.md
+++ b/src/main/resources/Documentation/about.md
@@ -8,6 +8,8 @@ Maintenance
 `GET /projects/{name}/demo-plugin~maintenance` answers
 `{"project":"<name>","maintenance":false}`. `PUT` switches maintenance on for
 that project and `DELETE` switches it off; both need the capability below.
+The same is available over SSH: `demo-plugin maintenance <project>` prints
+`maintenance on|off <project>`, and `--on` / `--off` switch it.
 The state is kept in memory and ends with a Gerrit restart.
 
 While a project is in maintenance, `ping` answers with the configured
